the resolved taxonomy `identifier_schemes.unreadable_id.pattern`: identifier integrity: cannot be read, so nothing can be said about what it admits: the pattern `{namespace}-{slug}-END` writes `{slug}` before another segment, and a free token has no stated end
the resolved taxonomy `shelves.partial.path`: determinism: cannot be read: `docs/ctx-{sequence}/**` writes `{sequence}` inside the segment `ctx-{sequence}`, and a shelf path binds a facet only as a whole segment, so nothing states where the value ends
the resolved taxonomy `shelves.twice.path`: determinism: binds `sequence` in more than one segment of `docs/teams/{sequence}/{sequence}/**`, so one document could give it two values
